sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Script
    participant M as Meraki API
    S->>M: calls 1 to 10 within one second
    M-->>S: 200 OK each
    S->>M: call 11 (same second, same org 549236)
    M-->>S: 429 Too Many Requests<br/>Retry-After: 1
    Note over S: sleep Retry-After seconds<br/>(SDK does this for you)
    S->>M: call 11 again
    M-->>S: 200 OK
